  59 00400 0000 VCAT,   .-.     / Move to X,Y
  60                            / Inline param1: X coord
  61                            / Inline param2: Y coord
  62                            / Return follows with AC = 0
  63                            / Uses: VCvariables
  64 00401 7200         CLA
  65 00402 1600         TAD I   VCAT    / get X
  66 00403 3335         DCA     VCX
  67 00404 1335         TAD     VCX
  68 00405 3336         DCA     VCXTMP
  69 00406 2200         ISZ     VCAT    / bump
  70 00407 1600         TAD I   VCAT    / get Y
