  72 00411 2200         ISZ     VCAT    / bump
  73 00412 5600         JMP I   VCAT
  74            
  75 00413 0000 VCTEXT, .-.     / Display text on screen, using inline params
  76                            / Inline param1: Address of text string
  77                            / Return follows with AC = 0
  78                            / Text is packed 6-bit stripped ASCII,
  79                            / where @ marks end of string and % is CRLF.
  80                            / Uses: VCvariables
  81 00414 7200         CLA
  82 00415 1613         TAD I   VCTEXT  / get text pointer
  83 00416 3236         DCA     VCTXPT
  84 00417 2213         ISZ     VCTEXT  / bump
  85            VCTLP,
  86 00420 1636         TAD I   VCTXPT  / get a pair of characters
  87 00421 7002         BSW
  88 00422 0235         AND     C077    / extract first
  89 00423 7450         SNA             / test for end of string
  90 00424 5613         JMP I   VCTEXT  /   if so, return
  91 00425 4237         JMS     VCCHAR  / else display it
  92 00426 1636         TAD I   VCTXPT
  93 00427 0235         AND     C077    / extract second
  94 00430 7450         SNA             / test for end of string
  95 00431 5613         JMP I   VCTEXT  /   if so, return
  96 00432 4237         JMS     VCCHAR  / else display it
  97 00433 2236         ISZ     VCTXPT
  98 00434 5220         JMP     VCTLP
