 141 00477 3334         DCA     VCDCSV  / save column
 142 00500 1336         TAD     VCXTMP
 143 00501 6053         DILX            / set X coord for column
 144 00502 1271         TAD     VCDOTS
 145 00503 3336         DCA     VCXTMP  / save updated X coord
 146 00504 1337         TAD     VCY     / get base Y coord
 147 00505 3340         DCA     VCYTMP  / save working copy of Y
 148 00506 4316         JMS     VCDROW  / show row 1
