 157 00516 0000 VCDROW, .-.     / Display a dot in a column
 158                            / on entry and exit, AC = 0
 159 00517 1340         TAD     VCYTMP
 160 00520 6054         DILY            / set Y coord for column
 161 00521 1271         TAD     VCDOTS
 162 00522 3340         DCA     VCYTMP  / save updated Y coord
 163 00523 1334         TAD     VCDCSV  / get column
 164 00524 7110         CLL RAR         / shift a bit into link
 165 00525 3334         DCA     VCDCSV  / save shifted column
 166 00526 7420         SNL
 167 00527 5716         JMP I   VCDROW  / return if no dot
 168 00530 6052         DISD
 169 00531 5330         JMP     .-1     / wait for ready
 170 00532 6055         DIXY            / intensify
 171 00533 5716         JMP I   VCDROW
