 180            VCTTAB, / array of bitmaps for each character.  Format:
 181                    /  2 words per character, giving 4 wide by 6 high
 182                    /  bitmap.  Left column in low byte of first word,
 183                    /  right column in high byte of last, bottom bit in
 184                    /  least significant position.
 185                    / entries are in trimmed ASCII order
